So we walked through each line,

00:36:52.550 --> 00:36:54.450
and I had no idea what was in it.

00:36:54.570 --> 00:36:57.950
I knew that the crew had an experienced captain

00:36:57.950 --> 00:36:59.780
and a lesser experienced.

00:37:00.000 --> 00:37:07.980
first officer we go second by second through the few minutes of this flight

