was asking for simulator training.

00:45:05.140 --> 00:45:07.610
He was disparaging them to his colleagues,

00:45:08.920 --> 00:45:09.700
calling them stupid.

00:45:12.200 --> 00:45:16.130
I mean, seriously, did that ever cross their minds

00:45:16.130 --> 00:45:19.640
that they were gonna let something go into the air

00:45:19.640 --> 00:45:23.000
that could potentially kill people?

00:45:26.570 --> 00:45:29.710
Boeing CEO Dennis Mullenberg appeared before Congress.

00:45:30.120 --> 00:45:33.880
Boeing's CEO is expected to acknowledge that his company made mistakes.

